          <p>Restart the mitophagy your cells stop doing — the one compound with a human trial.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Inside every cell is a recycling crew that clears out worn, damaged mitochondria — a process called mitophagy. After 40 it slows to a crawl, broken "power plants" pile up, and your energy and recovery quietly decline no matter what you take. Urolithin A restarts that cleanup, and it's the one longevity compound with a landmark human trial behind it (Singh, JAMA 2022: ~12% muscle strength at 16 weeks). It isn't a stimulant — you won't feel a buzz; you'll notice the recovery score on your watch finally moving, the soreness easing, the afternoon nap you stop needing. AgeAura gives you the exact 500mg clinical dose at 98%+ purity — the same the trials used — without the premium markup, and with a COA you can actually read.</p>
