          <p>The methyl donor most brands skip — built into the same capsule.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>NMN is the precursor your body converts into NAD+, the fuel that powers cellular energy — but there's a catch almost nobody warns you about. NMN burns through your methyl groups as it works, which is exactly why so many people feel great for two or three weeks, then nothing… and some even start waking at 3am. The fix is a methyl donor called TMG, and most brands either skip it or make you buy it separately. AgeAura builds it into the same capsule — 200mg NMN paired with 100mg TMG — so your NAD+ support stays methyl-balanced and the steady, all-day energy actually holds instead of fading on you.</p>
